{"id": "bart-certified-payroll-before-payment", "title": "BART directed payment before six certified payroll reports arrived", "seconds": 46.9, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "fa1295b7c7049218", "words": 108, "beats": [{"scene": "a", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "BART’s federal grant auditors sampled 40 certified payrolls.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.11, "shot": "t0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Certified", "payroll"], "sub": "Federal transit grants"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.91, 1.26, 1.8, 2.27, 2.69, 3.24]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Follow-up was late for 28 of them.", "t0": 4.23, "t1": 6.29, "shot": "t1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "28", "label": "Overdue payrolls"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.59, 0.79, 1.04, 1.2, 1.72, 1.81]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The reports documented weekly pay on federally funded construction.", "t0": 6.41, "t1": 10.49, "shot": "extra0", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The reports documented weekly pay on federally funded construction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.68, 1.29, 1.73, 2.28, 2.55, 3.0, 3.36]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "BART held back payment for 22.", "t0": 10.71, "t1": 12.94, "shot": "t2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "22", "label": "Payment withheld"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.65, 0.92, 1.34, 1.49]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "For six reports, payment instructions went out first.", "t0": 13.06, "t1": 16.03, "shot": "t3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "text": "six items", "mark": "six"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.54, 1.11, 1.48, 2.1, 2.28, 2.48]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The auditors listed no questioned costs.", "t0": 16.15, "t1": 18.6, "shot": "t4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "text": "Questioned Costs", "mark": "Costs"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.67, 1.07, 1.31, 1.87]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In 22 instances, BART waited for the records before paying.", "t0": 18.72, "t1": 23.02, "shot": "extra1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "In 22 instances, BART waited for the records before paying"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.73, 2.01, 2.39, 2.8, 2.92, 3.05, 3.49, 3.86]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "BART traced the omission to one subcontractor.", "t0": 23.24, "t1": 26.22, "shot": "t5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "text": "one subcontractor", "mark": "subcontractor"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.84, 1.0, 1.5, 1.7, 2.0]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Its worker had been mistaken for the prime contractor’s employee.", "t0": 26.34, "t1": 30.1, "shot": "t6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "text": "prime contractor", "mark": "contractor"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.57, 0.7, 0.88, 1.48, 1.62, 1.75, 2.19, 2.97]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The subcontractor later supplied every overdue report.", "t0": 30.22, "t1": 33.85, "shot": "t7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "text": "overdue", "mark": "overdue"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 1.14, 1.43, 1.99, 2.44, 3.07]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The fiscal 2017 audit marked the finding corrected.", "t0": 33.97, "t1": 37.31, "shot": "t8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy17", "text": "Corrected", "mark": "Corrected"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.68, 1.01, 1.54, 1.86, 2.14, 2.27, 2.75]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A resident engineer mistook the subcontractor’s worker for a prime contractor employee.", "t0": 37.43, "t1": 43.21, "shot": "extra2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A resident engineer mistook the subcontractor’s worker for a prime contractor employee"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.68, 1.27, 1.74, 1.85, 2.78, 3.6, 3.82, 3.92, 4.47, 5.11]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 43.33, "t1": 45.96, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.92, 1.11, 1.41, 1.49, 1.6, 1.86, 2.17]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"a": "The sample", "b": "Payment instructions", "c": "The missing reports"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "document"}